// DRAFT. Not applied. Makes jorah-projects' tools (plugins/jorah-projects, docs/plan/
// 11-project-mode.md section 5) reach main, the same way github-tools.patch.json5 did for the GitHub
// tools: OpenClaw offers a plugin's tools only when the agent's tool allow list permits them, and
// main has an explicit list. Only the plugin's names are added, not group:plugins. The guard decides
// each call (config/permission-matrix.json): list, status and pause read; digest and preview mark
// the chat; answers, results, run now, resume and start are a card after outside text or by voice;
// limits, connect, level and capabilities always.
//
// The plugin has nineteen tools: fourteen project_*, four toolbox_* and picture_save.
//   - The first twelve project_* tools were this file's first version (2026-11-16).
//   - toolbox_list, toolbox_propose, toolbox_install and toolbox_remove went live on 2026-11-18
//     (docs/runbooks/toolbox.md, "The Gateway part": main's list then had 37 entries).
//   - project_set_capabilities (web research and the robotics bench, always a card, issue #14) and
//     project_preview (rendered PNG and JPEG views into the workspace outbox, issue #16) are new
//     with the #13-#24 batch (docs/runbooks/deploy-13-24.md, step 4).
//   - picture_save (keeps pictures Adam sent, a read for the guard) is new on 2026-11-23
//     (docs/runbooks/hud-pictures.md, step 3, builds its patch from the live list).
//
// THE INSTALL SESSION READS THE LIVE LIST FIRST. Merge patch: the array is the WHOLE list, so an
// entry left out removes that tool from main. Below is the union of every list committed to main
// up to 2026-11-22 (github-tools and ios-tools patches, plus the tools install-site-readers.sh,
// install-google.sh, install-phone.sh, install-proactive.sh and the toolbox Gateway step add to the
// live list), 55 names, which may not be what is live. install-errands.sh's tools (price_compare,
// supply_save and the rest) are not in it, so applying this file as is would remove them.
// Never apply this file as is. On the PC:
//   openclaw --profile jorah config get agents.entries.main.tools.sandbox.tools.alsoAllow
// then build the patch from the live list plus project_set_capabilities and project_preview, as
// install-errands.sh does (docs/runbooks/deploy-13-24.md, step 4, has the exact command).
//
// Dry run: openclaw --profile jorah config patch --file <the built patch> --dry-run
// Expected: "Dry run successful" with one update, agents.entries.main.tools.sandbox.tools.alsoAllow.
// Apply after the plugin's new code is deployed and its consent re-given (plugins enable
// jorah-projects --accept-capabilities: it declares two new tools).
// Undo: the live list as it was (backup openclaw.json.pre-13-24), or the same list without the two
// new names.
{
  agents: {
    entries: {
      main: {
        tools: { sandbox: { tools: { alsoAllow: [
          "group:memory", "group:web", "browser", "message",
          "heartbeat_respond", "cron", "automations", "skill_workshop", "agents_list",
          "github_push_branch", "github_open_pr", "github_sync", "github_clone", "github_list_repos",
          "ios_build", "ios_install", "ios_status",
          "site_read", "sites_list",
          "calendar_read", "mail_read", "mail_open", "contact_search",
          "phone_today",
          "today_picture", "loops_list", "loop_propose", "loop_done", "loop_drop", "proactive_notify", "proactive_feedback",
          "proactive_resume", "proactive_why", "digest_list", "proactive_due", "proactive_tick",
          "project_list", "project_status", "project_digest", "project_answer", "project_note", "project_task_result",
          "project_run_now", "project_pause", "project_resume", "project_set_limits",
          "project_start", "project_connect", "project_set_level",
          "project_set_capabilities", "project_preview",
          "toolbox_list", "toolbox_propose", "toolbox_install", "toolbox_remove",
          "picture_save",
          "agentmemory__*",
        ] } } },
      },
    },
  },
}
